{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/8c3acb91e7e55d1ef4437e0adb3e0247.avif?t=1771609619\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras_big/8c3acb91e7e55d1ef4437e0adb3e0247.avif?t=1771609619 width=800 height=161 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The alien invasion has shattered Earth\u2019s defenses. Pilot, the fate of humanity now rests in your hands. Take the helm of a powerful mech and fight off the invasion\u2014one card at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>StarVaders</strong> combines tactical grid-based combat with deckbuilding strategy, placing you in command of a formidable mech during humanity\u2019s last stand against the invaders. Build up a deck of powerful cards, unleash devastating combos, and defend the Earth at all costs! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/683eceda366d60f0b3d7a708e19a67a8.poster.avif?t=1771609619\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/683eceda366d60f0b3d7a708e19a67a8.webm?t=1771609619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/683eceda366d60f0b3d7a708e19a67a8.mp4?t=1771609619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pilot Your Mech Into Battle!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mech in <strong>StarVaders</strong> has its own squad of pilots. Each mech introduces unique cards and mechanics, while your pilot further enhances your strategy with their distinct, powerful abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of the Gunner Mech to unleash an endless flurry of bullets and explosions, get up close and personal with the ninja-like Stinger Mech, or unleash the powerful spells and summons of the Keeper Mech! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/05b1fc73f17f69f6933b1a3b936375c1.poster.avif?t=1771609619\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/05b1fc73f17f69f6933b1a3b936375c1.webm?t=1771609619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/05b1fc73f17f69f6933b1a3b936375c1.mp4?t=1771609619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover Game-Breaking Combos!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash game-breaking combos, outsmart the invaders, and push your build to the limit against ever-escalating threats. With hundreds of cards, artifacts, and upgrades, no two runs are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missed a perfect combo or found yourself cornered by the invaders? Use a Chrono Token to rewind time and rewrite your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/a6f07804456f3a6550a8c70fa831ad5f.poster.avif?t=1771609619\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/a6f07804456f3a6550a8c70fa831ad5f.webm?t=1771609619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/a6f07804456f3a6550a8c70fa831ad5f.mp4?t=1771609619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each run, unlock powerful new cards, pilots, and deadlier enemies and bosses that raise the stakes in future battles. There\u2019s an endless supply of builds and combos to discover every time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to push your limits? Take on the various Challenge Modes or dive into the Daily Run to really prove what you\u2019re made of!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/138a03783c44647b53127132e053cf28.avif?t=1771609619\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"KA-BOOOOM!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2097570/066f0f01d676f91191ef5d410aac722b4de0a9c6.jpg"},{"name":"pewpewpewpewpewpew","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2097570/a0aa1ade2d60ecdf6a83bbf1e8008bd5f7062d2c.jpg"},{"name":"WOMBO COMBO","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2097570/ebfac5fb5c6fc3af1064d26b1d63b60d23989fef.jpg"},{"name":"Fire Fist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2097570/19e316e7d1128ca7e5ba1c42f51b0789b1b3491f.jpg"},{"name":"Lazengann Overload","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2097570/f86e770cd89407e8687d283cda60d1c13b602567.jpg"},{"name":"Maximalist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2097570/327998cc951246d7103d1d338046042fa0980601.jpg"},{"name":"Minimalist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2097570/62f695d9a2d256a73e0b183526afc2165616e7ce.jpg"},{"name":"Wild Cards","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2097570/e1de5d938f16536758821982c0536e79d74ace00.jpg"},{"name":"The Purge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2097570/c7ad138c7fefb8f5825b06b095d17a3e052c582b.jpg"},{"name":"Flawless Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2097570/4b0933be212ad457c64ba6fc6b209401b9b760c9.jpg"}],"total":100},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2097570?t=1771609619","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771609619","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/d5103aaa1aa58cab3954d144278b36e80526c93b/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_4.jpg?t=1771609619","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/d5103aaa1aa58cab3954d144278b36e80526c93b/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_4.jpg?t=1771609619","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2417280,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/16d2c89129173ada3aae5241cb1ef2af.avif?t=1771609619\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras_big/16d2c89129173ada3aae5241cb1ef2af.avif?t=1771609619 width=800 height=161 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft the ultimate deck from the <strong>400+ unique cards and artifacts</strong> available!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>3 powerful mechs</strong>, each with completely <strong>distinct playstyles and mechanics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master <strong>12 diverse pilots</strong>, each adding new cards, mechanics, and a personal backstory!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>Chrono Tokens</strong> to rewind time, undo mistakes, or land that perfect combo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through the <strong>multi-part story campaign</strong> and uncover a secret finale!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless replayability with <strong>ascending difficulties</strong>, <strong>daily runs</strong>, and <strong>challenge modes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for <strong>clarity and intuition</strong>\u2014no long tutorials, no wiki required, just pure tactical deckbuilding</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/cd0fa1196978c1c1058cf732a899dac4.avif?t=1771609619\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/8c3acb91e7e55d1ef4437e0adb3e0247.avif?t=1771609619\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras_big/8c3acb91e7e55d1ef4437e0adb3e0247.avif?t=1771609619 width=800 height=161 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The alien invasion has shattered Earth\u2019s defenses. Pilot, the fate of humanity now rests in your hands. Take the helm of a powerful mech and fight off the invasion\u2014one card at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>StarVaders</strong> combines tactical grid-based combat with deckbuilding strategy, placing you in command of a formidable mech during humanity\u2019s last stand against the invaders. Build up a deck of powerful cards, unleash devastating combos, and defend the Earth at all costs! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/683eceda366d60f0b3d7a708e19a67a8.poster.avif?t=1771609619\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/683eceda366d60f0b3d7a708e19a67a8.webm?t=1771609619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/683eceda366d60f0b3d7a708e19a67a8.mp4?t=1771609619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pilot Your Mech Into Battle!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mech in <strong>StarVaders</strong> has its own squad of pilots. Each mech introduces unique cards and mechanics, while your pilot further enhances your strategy with their distinct, powerful abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of the Gunner Mech to unleash an endless flurry of bullets and explosions, get up close and personal with the ninja-like Stinger Mech, or unleash the powerful spells and summons of the Keeper Mech! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/05b1fc73f17f69f6933b1a3b936375c1.poster.avif?t=1771609619\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/05b1fc73f17f69f6933b1a3b936375c1.webm?t=1771609619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/05b1fc73f17f69f6933b1a3b936375c1.mp4?t=1771609619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover Game-Breaking Combos!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash game-breaking combos, outsmart the invaders, and push your build to the limit against ever-escalating threats. With hundreds of cards, artifacts, and upgrades, no two runs are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missed a perfect combo or found yourself cornered by the invaders? Use a Chrono Token to rewind time and rewrite your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/a6f07804456f3a6550a8c70fa831ad5f.poster.avif?t=1771609619\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/a6f07804456f3a6550a8c70fa831ad5f.webm?t=1771609619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/a6f07804456f3a6550a8c70fa831ad5f.mp4?t=1771609619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each run, unlock powerful new cards, pilots, and deadlier enemies and bosses that raise the stakes in future battles. There\u2019s an endless supply of builds and combos to discover every time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to push your limits? Take on the various Challenge Modes or dive into the Daily Run to really prove what you\u2019re made of!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/138a03783c44647b53127132e053cf28.avif?t=1771609619\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p>","developers":["Pengonauts"],"dlc":[3631030,3632550],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/d1b9f942d77a2559030e46d545d9a1c07b505f4e/header_alt_assets_4.jpg?t=1771609619","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX 10.14+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"},"metacritic":{"score":85,"url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/pc/starvaders?ftag=MCD-06-10aaa1f"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2097570/881016/97b03af52ebc47874f2cde31b757863cbea03b75/1750746683/dash_av1.mpd?t=1746026207","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2097570/881016/97b03af52ebc47874f2cde31b757863cbea03b75/1750746683/dash_h264.mpd?t=1746026207","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2097570/881016/97b03af52ebc47874f2cde31b757863cbea03b75/1750746683/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1746026207","id":257132842,"name":"StarVaders Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st